  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "**简体中文** · [English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "FFmpeg",
      "text": "**把已有音视频处理成需要的成品。**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ffmpeg) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ffmpeg) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ffmpeg)\n\n**[安装使用](#安装) · [使用流程](#开始使用) · [完整说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "FFmpeg",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-light.svg\" alt=\"把已有音视频处理成需要的成品。 · 流程示意\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 查看媒体参数，按采样时间浏览视频总览图。\n- 裁切、拼接、转码、加字幕或提取画面。\n- 保留源文件，实际播放输出后再交付。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 DSH 桌面版「插件」面板安装 `dsh-ffmpeg`。已配置命令行时也可使用：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-ffmpeg\n```\n\n网页版把 `desktop` 改为 `web`；安装后重启对应的 DSH。宿主要求以包声明 `>=0.2.1-rc.3` 为准。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始使用",
      "text": "1. 安装 FFmpeg/ffprobe，并在 DSH 中运行 ffmpeg_health 检查可执行文件。\n2. 把输入文件放在当前工作区或提供准确的本地路径，说明想要的片段和输出规格。\n3. 想先看内容时，让助手用 ffmpeg_storyboard 生成总览图，按每格采样时间定位片段。\n4. 选择裁切、拼接、转码或抽帧等操作；默认保留源文件，重名成品另取文件名。\n5. 按返回路径打开成品，用 ffmpeg_probe 检查参数，并实际播放核对画面和声音。\n\n可以这样说：\n\n> 先为这个视频生成带采样时间的总览图，保留原文件，再让我选择要剪的片段。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始前要知道",
      "text": "需要本机 FFmpeg / ffprobe；输入与输出应位于允许访问的位置。\n\n配置、完整工具与排错见[详细使用说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "插件更新",
      "text": "在工作台或原生插件详情页底部检查更新。默认自动检查，**默认不自动安装**；是否安装、何时重启由你决定。Suite 管理的组件随整包更新。[查看更新规则](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "文档",
      "text": "- [详细使用、配置与边界](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)\n- [更新记录](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [验证范围与历史](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/VALIDATION.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "反馈与贡献",
      "text": "如果插件帮到了你，欢迎 Star，让更多人发现它。问题和建议请提交 [Issues](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/issues)，也欢迎代码与文档 [PR](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/pulls)。反馈时附上版本与复现步骤，并移除凭据。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/LICENSE)\n\n<a id=\"依赖与配置\"></a>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) · **English**"
    },
    {
      "section": "FFmpeg",
      "text": "**Turn existing media into the output you need.**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ffmpeg) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ffmpeg) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ffmpeg)\n\n**[Install](#install) · [Workflow](#start-using-it) · [Full guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "FFmpeg",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-light.svg\" alt=\"Turn existing media into the output you need. · workflow illustration\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Inspect media parameters and timestamped contact sheets.\n- Trim, join, transcode, add subtitles or extract frames.\n- Keep the source and play the output before delivery."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Open **Plugins** in the DSH desktop app and install `dsh-ffmpeg`. If the CLI is available:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-ffmpeg\n```\n\nFor the web profile, replace `desktop` with `web`. Restart that DSH profile after installation. The package’s DSH requirement is `>=0.2.1-rc.3`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "1. Install FFmpeg/ffprobe and run ffmpeg_health in DSH to check the executables.\n2. Place the input in your workspace or provide its exact local path, and describe the clip and output requirements.\n3. Use ffmpeg_storyboard to inspect a contact sheet first; locate segments using the returned cell sample times.\n4. Choose trimming, joining, encoding or extraction. Source files are protected and existing output gets a new name by default.\n5. Open the returned output, inspect it with ffmpeg_probe, and play it to check both picture and sound."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "Example request：\n\n> Create a timestamped contact sheet first, keeping the source intact, then let me choose a clip."
    },
    {
      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "Requires local FFmpeg/ffprobe and access to the input and output locations.\n\nConfiguration, detailed tools and troubleshooting: [full reference](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin updates",
      "text": "Check updates at the bottom of the workbench or native plugin details. Automatic checks are on by default; **automatic installation is off**. You choose whether to install and when to restart. Suite-managed components update with their bundle. [Update behavior](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Documentation",
      "text": "- [Full usage, configuration and limits](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Validation scope and history](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/blob/master/docs/VALIDATION.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Feedback and contributions",
      "text": "If the plugin helps, a Star makes it easier for others to discover. Report problems or suggest improvements in [Issues](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/issues); code and documentation [PRs](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ffmpeg/pulls) are welcome. Include versions and reproduction steps, and remove credentials from reports."
    },
